{"1":{"w":[{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"Nay!"},{"c":"أُقْسِمُ","d":"uq'simu","e":"I swear"},{"c":"بِهَذَا","d":"bihādhā","e":"by this"},{"c":"الْبَلَدِ","d":"l-baladi","e":"city"}],"a":{"g":"I swear by this city, Makkah -"}},"2":{"w":[{"c":"وَأَنْتَ","d":"wa-anta","e":"And you"},{"c":"حِلٌّ","d":"ḥillun","e":"(are) free (to dwell)"},{"c":"بِهَذَا","d":"bihādhā","e":"in this"},{"c":"الْبَلَدِ","d":"l-baladi","e":"city"}],"a":{"g":"And you, [O Muhammad], are free of restriction in this city -"}},"3":{"w":[{"c":"وَوَالِدٍ","d":"wawālidin","e":"And the begetter"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"and what"},{"c":"وَلَدَ","d":"walada","e":"he begot"}],"a":{"g":"And [by] the father and that which was born [of him],"}},"4":{"w":[{"c":"لَقَدْ","d":"laqad","e":"Certainly"},{"c":"خَلَقْنَا","d":"khalaqnā","e":"We have created"},{"c":"الْإِنْسَانَ","d":"l-insāna","e":"man"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"(to be) in"},{"c":"كَبَدٍ","d":"kabadin","e":"hardship"}],"a":{"g":"We have certainly created man into hardship."}},"5":{"w":[{"c":"أَيَحْسَبُ","d":"ayaḥsabu","e":"Does he think"},{"c":"أَنْ","d":"an","e":"that"},{"c":"لَنْ","d":"lan","e":"not"},{"c":"يَقْدِرَ","d":"yaqdira","e":"has power"},{"c":"عَلَيْهِ","d":"ʿalayhi","e":"over him"},{"c":"أَحَدٌ","d":"aḥadun","e":"anyone"}],"a":{"g":"Does he think that never will anyone overcome him?"}},"6":{"w":[{"c":"يَقُولُ","d":"yaqūlu","e":"He will say"},{"c":"أَهْلَكْتُ","d":"ahlaktu","e":"I have squandered"},{"c":"مَالًا","d":"mālan","e":"wealth"},{"c":"لُبَدًا","d":"lubadan","e":"abundant"}],"a":{"g":"He says, \"I have spent wealth in abundance.\""}},"7":{"w":[{"c":"أَيَحْسَبُ","d":"ayaḥsabu","e":"Does he think"},{"c":"أَنْ","d":"an","e":"that"},{"c":"لَمْ","d":"lam","e":"not"},{"c":"يَرَهُ","d":"yarahu","e":"sees him"},{"c":"أَحَدٌ","d":"aḥadun","e":"anyone"}],"a":{"g":"Does he think that no one has seen him?"}},"8":{"w":[{"c":"أَلَمْ","d":"alam","e":"Have not"},{"c":"نَجْعَلْ","d":"najʿal","e":"We made"},{"c":"لَهُ","d":"lahu","e":"for him"},{"c":"عَيْنَيْنِ","d":"ʿaynayni","e":"two eyes"}],"a":{"g":"Have We not made for him two eyes?"}},"9":{"w":[{"c":"وَلِسَانًا","d":"walisānan","e":"And a tongue"},{"c":"وَشَفَتَيْنِ","d":"washafatayni","e":"and two lips"}],"a":{"g":"And a tongue and two lips?"}},"10":{"w":[{"c":"وَهَدَيْنَاهُ","d":"wahadaynāhu","e":"And shown him"},{"c":"النَّجْدَيْنِ","d":"l-najdayni","e":"the two ways"}],"a":{"g":"And have shown him the two ways?"}},"11":{"w":[{"c":"فَلَا","d":"falā","e":"But not"},{"c":"اقْتَحَمَ","d":"iq'taḥama","e":"he has attempted"},{"c":"الْعَقَبَةَ","d":"l-ʿaqabata","e":"the steep path"}],"a":{"g":"But he has not broken through the difficult pass."}},"12":{"w":[{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"And what"},{"c":"أَدْرَاكَ","d":"adrāka","e":"can make you know"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"what"},{"c":"الْعَقَبَةُ","d":"l-ʿaqabatu","e":"the steep path is"}],"a":{"g":"And what can make you know what is [breaking through] the difficult pass?"}},"13":{"w":[{"c":"فَكُّ","d":"fakku","e":"(It is) freeing"},{"c":"رَقَبَةٍ","d":"raqabatin","e":"a neck"}],"a":{"g":"It is the freeing of a slave"}},"14":{"w":[{"c":"أَوْ","d":"aw","e":"Or"},{"c":"إِطْعَامٌ","d":"iṭ'ʿāmun","e":"feeding"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"يَوْمٍ","d":"yawmin","e":"a day"},{"c":"ذِي","d":"dhī","e":"of"},{"c":"مَسْغَبَةٍ","d":"masghabatin","e":"severe hunger"}],"a":{"g":"Or feeding on a day of severe hunger"}},"15":{"w":[{"c":"يَتِيمًا","d":"yatīman","e":"An orphan"},{"c":"ذَا","d":"dhā","e":"of"},{"c":"مَقْرَبَةٍ","d":"maqrabatin","e":"near relationship"}],"a":{"g":"An orphan of near relationship"}},"16":{"w":[{"c":"أَوْ","d":"aw","e":"Or"},{"c":"مِسْكِينًا","d":"mis'kīnan","e":"a needy person"},{"c":"ذَا","d":"dhā","e":"in"},{"c":"مَتْرَبَةٍ","d":"matrabatin","e":"misery"}],"a":{"g":"Or a needy person in misery"}},"17":{"w":[{"c":"ثُمَّ","d":"thumma","e":"Then"},{"c":"كَانَ","d":"kāna","e":"he is"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"of"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"those who"},{"c":"ءَامَنُوا","d":"āmanū","e":"believe"},{"c":"وَتَوَاصَوْا","d":"watawāṣaw","e":"and enjoin each other"},{"c":"بِالصَّبْرِ","d":"bil-ṣabri","e":"to patience"},{"c":"وَتَوَاصَوْا","d":"watawāṣaw","e":"and enjoin each other"},{"c":"بِالْمَرْحَمَةِ","d":"bil-marḥamati","e":"to compassion"}],"a":{"g":"And then being among those who believed and advised one another to patience and advised one another to compassion."}},"18":{"w":[{"c":"أُولَئِكَ","d":"ulāika","e":"Those"},{"c":"أَصْحَابُ","d":"aṣḥābu","e":"(are the) companions"},{"c":"الْمَيْمَنَةِ","d":"l-maymanati","e":"(of) the right hand"}],"a":{"g":"Those are the companions of the right."}},"19":{"w":[{"c":"وَالَّذِينَ","d":"wa-alladhīna","e":"But those who"},{"c":"كَفَرُوا","d":"kafarū","e":"disbelieve"},{"c":"بِءَايَاتِنَا","d":"biāyātinā","e":"in Our Verses"},{"c":"هُمْ","d":"hum","e":"they"},{"c":"أَصْحَابُ","d":"aṣḥābu","e":"(are the) companions"},{"c":"الْمَشْءَمَةِ","d":"l-mashamati","e":"(of) the left hand"}],"a":{"g":"But they who disbelieved in Our signs - those are the companions of the left."}},"20":{"w":[{"c":"عَلَيْهِمْ","d":"ʿalayhim","e":"Over them"},{"c":"نَارٌ","d":"nārun","e":"(will be the) Fire"},{"c":"مُؤْصَدَةٌ","d":"mu'ṣadatun","e":"closed in"}],"a":{"g":"Over them will be fire closed in."}}}